WEBVTT

00:07:27.818 --> 00:07:31.038
And let's give all four of these people
a nice round of applause.

00:07:31.062 --> 00:07:32.596
Thank you very much.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.294
(Applause)

00:07:38.162 --> 00:07:39.797
(Applause ends)

00:07:40.853 --> 00:07:41.976
For my next number --

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.948
(Laughter)

00:07:44.972 --> 00:07:47.836
while I mentally recharge my batteries,

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.508
I have one more question for the audience.

00:07:50.532 --> 00:07:54.976
By any chance, does anybody
here happen to know

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.334
the day of the week
that they were born on?

00:07:58.358 --> 00:08:02.278
If you think you know
your birth day, raise your hand.